                    <msContents>
                        <summary>Arzneibuch : written by several hands, in a South German dialect. An inserted slip, by the same hand as that of part of the text, contains the names of various members of the Blass Family, and the name of Marcus Blass is written inside the lower cover. Inside the upper cover are the initials MB, and the names of Philipp, Caspar and Marcus Blass.</summary>
